Here is the input problem:
  Axiom 1 (types8): true = true.
  Axiom 2 (types7): false = false.
  Axiom 3 (leq_1): leq(zero, X) = true.
  Axiom 4 (leq_2): leq(suc(X), zero) = false.
  Axiom 5 (leq_3): leq(suc(X), suc(Y)) = leq(X, Y).
  Axiom 6 (eqNat_1): eqNat(zero, zero) = true.
  Axiom 7 (eqNat_2): eqNat(zero, suc(X)) = false.
  Axiom 8 (eqNat_3): eqNat(suc(X), zero) = false.
  Axiom 9 (eqNat_4): eqNat(suc(X), suc(Y)) = eqNat(X, Y).
  Axiom 10 (implies_2): implies(true, X) = X.
  Axiom 11 (implies_1): implies(false, X) = true.
  Axiom 12 (types9): X = X.
  Axiom 13 (types3): implies(X, Y) = implies(X, Y).
  Axiom 14 (types2): implies(X, Y) = implies(X, Y).
  Axiom 15 (types6): prop_leqAntisym(X, Y) = prop_leqAntisym(X, Y).
  Axiom 16 (types5): leq(X, Y) = leq(X, Y).
  Axiom 17 (types4): eqNat(X, Y) = eqNat(X, Y).
  Axiom 18 (types1): implies(X, Y) = implies(X, Y).
  Axiom 19 (prop_leqAntisym_1): prop_leqAntisym(X, Y) = implies(leq(X, Y), eqNat(X, Y)).
  Axiom 20 (reflexivity): equals(X, X) = true.
  Axiom 21 (prop_leqAntisym): equals(prop_leqAntisym(X, Y), false) = false.
  Goal 1 (true_equals_false): true = false.

